	hex "VCPU PMIC ID bit0 GPIO number"
	depends on PMIC_IF_AUTO
	default 0xff
	help
		GPIO number used for PMIC auto-detection.
		The value sampled from this GPIO is used as PMIC ID bit0.
		Together with PMIC ID bit1, it forms a 2-bit [bit1:bit0] PMIC
		identification code.
		Refer to the board schematic and PMIC datasheet for the
		corresponding GPIO numbers.

		- SoC GPIO:
